         Oregon / June 11, 1990" - the quoted sentence on why the project was undertaken.
         source: Zybach 1999 thesis - title page and abstract page (title; presented March 5,
         1999; 321 pp.); Chapter 2, printed p.43, for the quoted sentence naming the two
         interviewers.
         source: "Soap Creek Valley Oral History Series, 1989 - 1999",
         nwmapsco.com/ZybachB/Oral_Histories/Soap_Creek_Valley/, read 4 September 2026 - the
         fifteen monographs with full citations, and the page's own byline "Bob Zybach, PhD,
         Soap Creek Valley Oral History Series Editor".
         source: orww.org, read 4 September 2026 - ORWW "first conceived and designed in Fall
